# obscure ring / finite-field commands with NO stress area: matinv, matsolve, irreducibility
matinv [[1,2],[3,4]] mod 5
matinv [[1,2,3],[0,1,4],[0,0,1]] mod 7
matsolve [[1,2],[3,4]] [1,2] mod 5
matsolve [[1,1],[2,2]] [1,2] mod 5
irreducible x^8 + x^4 + x^3 + x + 1 over GF(2)
primitive x^8 + x^4 + x^3 + x + 1 over GF(2)
zerodivisors sedenion
ring z/8 zerodivisors
